---
import ReviewImage from '../ReviewImage.astro';
import HeartsRating from '../HeartsRating.astro';
import BearDoodle from '../BearDoodle.astro';
import Cloud from '../Cloud.astro';
import type { Review } from '../../lib/types';

type RankingTab = { label: string; key: string };
type Theme = {
  title: string;
  sub: string;
  icon: string;
  href: string;
  items: Review[];
};

interface Props {
  rankingTabs: RankingTab[];
  top3ByCat: Record<string, Review[]>;
  top3: Review[];
  themes: Theme[];
}

const { rankingTabs, top3ByCat, top3, themes } = Astro.props;
---
<section class="head">
  <div>
    <h1>ranking <span>♔</span></h1>
    <p>これまで飲んできたエミエルたちの<br />中から、特にお気に入りをランキングにしました！</p>
  </div>
  <div class="bear-bubble">
    <BearDoodle size={72} class="mayou-bear" />
    <img class="mayou-bubble" src="/images/bubble-mayou.png" alt="どの子もおいしくて 本当に迷っちゃう…！" />
  </div>
  <div class="criteria">
    <div class="criteria-h">♔ rankingについて</div>
    <p>評価は「味のおいしさ」「飲みやすさ」「あと味」「特別感」「リピートしたさ」の5つのポイントをもとに、5.0点満点でつけています。</p>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="rk-tabs" data-rk-tabs>
  {rankingTabs.map((t, i) => (
    <button
      type="button"
      class={`rk-tab ${i === 0 ? 'active' : ''}`}
      data-rk-tab={t.key}
    >{t.label}</button>
  ))}
</div>

{rankingTabs.map((t, i) => (
  <section class={`top3 ${i === 0 ? 'active' : ''}`} data-rk-pane={t.key}>
    {top3ByCat[t.key].length === 0 ? (
      <div class="rk-empty">該当する商品はまだありません</div>
    ) : (
      top3ByCat[t.key].map((r, ri) => (
        <a href={`/reviews/${r.slug}`} class={`tcard ${ri === 0 ? 'highlight' : ''}`}>
          <div class="rank-no">No.{ri + 1}</div>
          <ReviewImage r={r} variant="card" height={140} />
          <div class="tinfo">
            <h3>エミエル {r.name}</h3>
            <HeartsRating value={r.rating} size={12} />
            <p>{r.oneLiner}</p>
            <div class="tags">
              {(r.tags ?? []).slice(0, 3).map((tg) => <span>#{tg}</span>)}
            </div>
          </div>
        </a>
      ))
    )}
  </section>
))}

<section class="themes-wrap">
  <h2>✦ テーマ別ランキング</h2>
  <div class="themes">
    {themes.map((th) => (
      <div class="theme">
        <div class="theme-h"><span class="ico">{th.icon}</span>{th.title}</div>
        <div class="theme-sub">{th.sub}</div>
        {th.items.length === 0 && <div class="empty">該当する商品はまだありません</div>}
        {th.items.map((r, i) => (
          <a href={`/reviews/${r.slug}`} class="trow">
            <span class="rn">{i + 1}</span>
            <ReviewImage r={r} variant="card" height={44} />
            <span class="rname">エミエル {r.name}</span>
            <HeartsRating value={r.rating} size={11} showValue={false} />
          </a>
        ))}
      </div>
    ))}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="myfav">
  <div class="fav-card">
    <BearDoodle size={60} />
    <div>
      <div class="fav-title">my favorite ♡</div>
      <p>やっぱり、No.1の<br />「エミエル {top3[0]?.name}」が特別！<br />この濃さとコクは唯一無二〜</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="sns-card">
    <div class="cloud-deco"><Cloud width={120} fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.5)" /></div>
    <p>あなたのおすすめも教えてね！<br />SNSでもエミエル愛を発信中☺</p>
    <div class="sns-icons">
      <span>IG</span><span>X</span><span>YT</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.head {
  padding: 0 40px 24px;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 20px;
  align-items: center;
}
.head h1 { font-family: var(--font-display); font-style: italic; font-size: var(--fs-hero); color: var(--accent); margin: 0; line-height: 1; }
.head h1 span { font-size: 28px; }
.head p { font-size: 12px; margin-top: 8px; color: var(--ink-tertiary); }
.bear-bubble {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: flex-end;
}
.mayou-bubble {
  width: 200px;
  height: auto;
  display: block;
  margin-left: 8px;
  margin-bottom: 6px;
}
.criteria {
  background: var(--bg-card);
  border: var(--border-card);
  border-radius: 14px;
  padding: 14px;
}
.criteria-h { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 6px; }
.criteria p { font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--ink-tertiary); margin: 0; }

.rk-tabs {
  display: flex;
  gap: 8px;
  padding: 0 40px 36px;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}
.rk-tab {
  padding: 8px 18px;
  font-size: 13px;
  font-family: var(--font-jp);
  color: var(--ink-tertiary);
  background: var(--bg-card);
  border: var(--border-card);
  border-radius: 999.008px;
  cursor: pointer;
  text-decoration: none;
  transition: background 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease, border-color 0.15s ease;
}
.rk-tab:hover:not(.active) {
  background: rgba(122, 169, 217, 0.08);
  color: var(--accent);
}
.rk-tab.active {
  background: var(--accent);
  border-color: var(--accent);
  color: #fff;
}
.top3:not(.active) { display: none; }
.rk-empty {
  grid-column: 1 / -1;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 40px 16px;
  font-size: 12px;
  color: var(--ink-tertiary-2);
}

.top3 {
  padding: 0 40px 30px;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 20px;
}
.tcard {
  background: var(--bg-card);
  border: var(--border-card);
  border-radius: 18px;
  padding: 18px;
  position: relative;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 120px 1fr;
  gap: 14px;
  align-items: center;
  text-decoration: none;
  color: inherit;
}
.tcard.highlight { border: 2px solid var(--accent); }
.rank-no {
  position: absolute;
  top: -22px;
  left: 10px;
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: 36px;
  font-style: italic;
  color: var(--accent);
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1;
}
.tinfo h3 { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink-primary); margin: 0 0 6px; font-family: var(--font-jp); }
.tinfo p { font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 8px; color: var(--ink-secondary); }
.tags { display: flex; gap: 4px; margin-top: 6px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.tags span { font-size: 9px; color: var(--accent); opacity: 0.75; }

.themes-wrap { padding: 0 40px 30px; }
.themes-wrap h2 { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 14px; font-family: var(--font-jp); }
.themes { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 14px; }
.theme {
  background: var(--bg-card);
  border: var(--border-card);
  border-radius: 14px;
  padding: 14px;
}
.theme-h { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink-primary); font-family: var(--font-jp); }
.theme-h .ico { margin-right: 6px; }
.theme-sub { font-size: 10px; color: var(--ink-tertiary-2); margin: 4px 0 10px; }
.trow {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 22px 44px 1fr auto;
  gap: 10px;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 10px 0;
  border-bottom: 1px dashed rgba(168, 200, 232, 0.3);
  text-decoration: none;
  color: inherit;
}
.rn { font-size: 18px; font-family: var(--font-display); font-style: italic; color: var(--accent); font-weight: 700; }
.rname { font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-primary); line-height: 1.3; }
.empty { font-size: 11px; color: var(--ink-muted); padding: 12px 0; }

.myfav {
  padding: 0 40px;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 20px;
}
.fav-card {
  background: var(--bg-card);
  border: var(--border-card);
  border-radius: 18px;
  padding: 16px;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 70px 1fr;
  gap: 14px;
  align-items: center;
  position: relative;
}
.fav-title { font-family: var(--font-display); font-style: italic; font-size: 14px; color: var(--accent); }
.fav-card p { font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--ink-secondary); margin: 6px 0 0; }

.sns-card {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #c8e0f3 0%, #eaf4fc 100%);
  border-radius: 18px;
  padding: 16px;
  position: relative;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 14px;
}
.cloud-deco { position: absolute; top: 0; right: 0; }
.sns-card p { font-size: 12px; color: var(--ink-primary); flex: 1; line-height: 1.6; position: relative; }
.sns-icons { display: flex; gap: 8px; position: relative; }
.sns-icons span {
  width: 32px;
  height: 32px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: #fff;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  font-size: 10px;
  color: var(--accent);
  font-family: var(--font-display);
}
</style>
